azards such as electrical hazard, bodies of water and vehicular traffic training and handling and storing blood or bodily fluids training.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026408911","violation_type_title":"Documented Annual Training - Remaining training hour topics (26 TAC §746.1309(f))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2909-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021","date":"2025-10-21","original_code":"746.2909(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-11-06","finding":"Arrangement of Napping Equipment - Not Blocking Entrances or Exits: Cots were arranged in a manner that blocked an exit to the building and an exit of a classroom.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026488632","violation_type_title":"Arrangement of Napping Equipment - Not Blocking Entrances or Exits (26 TAC §746.2909(1))","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3301-f-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021","date":"2025-10-21","original_code":"746.3301(f)(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-11-06","finding":"Nutrition and Food Service - Drinking water available at every snack, mealtime, and during and after active play: Outside time was observed and water was not available during active play.","topic":"food","source_record_id":"1026328562","violation_type_title":"Nutrition and Food Service - Drinking water available at every snack, mealtime, and during and after active play (26 TAC §746.3301(f)(1))","topic_label":"Food & nutrition"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5625-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1308376-i20251021","date":"2025-10-21","original_code":"746.5625(b)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High ris